option.A_SVGF_VARIANCE_THRESHOLD.comment = Selects the a-svgf variance threshold mode or method.
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_BIAS=Indirect Lighting Bias
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_BIAS.comment = Controls indirect lighting bias.
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_RADIUS=Indirect Lighting Radius
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_RADIUS.comment = Controls indirect lighting radius.
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_SMOOTHNESS=Indirect Lighting Smoothness
option.INDIRECT_LIGHTING_SMOOTHNESS.comment = Controls indirect lighting smoothness.
option.IBL=Image Based Lighting
option.IBL_TEMPORAL_ACCUMULATION=IBL Temporal Accumulation
option.IBL_TEMPORAL_ACCUMULATION.comment=Accumulate diffuse irradiance samples over multiple frames using reprojected history instead of resampling from scratch each frame. Greatly reduces noise with no loss of sky detail, at the cost of brief lag when lighting changes suddenly or on disocclusion.
option.IBL.comment = Enable image-based lighting using a precomputed split-sum approximation. Adds diffuse irradiance and prefiltered specular reflections sampled from the live sky map. Costs ~12ms/frame on M1.
option.IBL_DIFFUSE_SAMPLES=IBL Diffuse Samples
option.IBL_DIFFUSE_SAMPLES.comment = Sample count for the diffuse irradiance precompute. Higher = less noise, lower performance.
option.IBL_DIFFUSE_INTENSITY=IBL Diffuse Intensity
option.IBL_DIFFUSE_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness multiplier for the diffuse IBL contribution.
option.IBL_SPECULAR_SAMPLES=IBL Specular Samples
option.IBL_SPECULAR_SAMPLES.comment = Sample count for the prefiltered specular panorama. Higher = less noise, lower performance.
option.IBL_SPECULAR_INTENSITY=IBL Specular Intensity
option.IBL_SPECULAR_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness multiplier for the specular IBL contribution.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING=Fog Smoothing
option.FOG_SMOOTHING.comment = Controls fog smoothing.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS=Fog Smoothing Radius
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS.comment = Controls fog smoothing radius.
option.CLOUD_LIGHTING_BOUNCES=Cloud Lighting Bounces
option.CLOUD_LIGHTING_BOUNCES.comment = Toggles cloud lighting bounces.
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE=Material Mapping Mode
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE.comment = Controls how PBR material textures (specular/normal maps via labPBR or OldSchoolPBR conventions) are decoded from resource packs. OFF disables, HARDCODED uses built-in per-block values, SPECULAR_ONLY reads just the specular map, NORMALS_ONLY reads just the normal map, SPECULAR_NORMALS reads both.
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_OFF=Off
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_HARDCODED=Hardcoded Specular
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_SPECULAR_ONLY=Specular Only
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_NORMALS_ONLY=Normals Only
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_SPECULAR_NORMALS=Specular + Normal Mapping
option.POROSITY=Porosity
option.POROSITY.comment = Enable porosity-based wetness on blocks. Porous blocks (dirt, sand, etc.) darken and become wet when raining.
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH=Porosity Strength
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH.comment = Multiplier for the porosity darkening effect.
option.SSS=SSS
option.SSS.comment = Enable subsurface scattering on organic blocks (leaves, wax, skin). Light enters the surface, scatters inside, and exits at a different point — gives a soft, translucent look.
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY=SSS Sheen Intensity
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness multiplier for the subsurface sheen effect.
